<title>ISRAEL: Second Israeli dies of wounds in shooting.</title>
<headline>Second Israeli dies of wounds in shooting.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Television said on Wednesday that a second Israeli had died of wounds from a drive-by shooting by gunmen near the PLO-ruled West Bank town of Ramallah.</p>
<p>It said the Israeli died in hospital. The Israeli army said five other Israelis were wounded in the attack.</p>
